{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash Full Parameter Reference (Responses API)",
    "description": "Complete API reference for the MiniMax-M3.1-Flash Responses endpoint.\n\n**Preview model**: MiniMax-M3.1-Flash is a preview release. Its behavior and parameters may change.\n\n**Model capabilities**:\n- Positioning: MiniMax's fast model for day-to-day coding and agent workflows\n- Context window: **1,000,000 tokens** (1M)\n- Max output: **524,288 tokens** (512K), recommended up to **131,072 tokens** (128K)\n- Thinking: always on and cannot be turned off; set the depth with `reasoning.effort` (default `max`). Thinking is returned as a `reasoning` output item\n- Multimodal input: text, images, and video\n- Tool calling: Function Calling\n\n**Stateless**: The endpoint stores no conversations; multi-turn conversations require the client to send the full history in `input` on every request.",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://direct.evolink.ai",
      "description": "Production (Recommended)"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "Alternative URL"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Chat Completion",
      "description": "AI chat completion related endpoints"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/responses": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Chat Completion"
        ],
        "summary": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash Responses API (OpenAI-compatible)",
        "description": "**Preview model**: MiniMax-M3.1-Flash is a preview release. Its behavior and parameters may change.\n\n- Call MiniMax-M3.1-Flash using the OpenAI Responses protocol\n- **Input shapes**: `input` can be plain text or an array of input items (message, function call, function call output, reasoning)\n- **Multimodal input**: user messages accept `input_image` and `input_video` content parts\n- **System instructions**: provided via `instructions`, equivalent to a leading system message\n- **Thinking**: always on; set the depth with `reasoning.effort`. The `output` array starts with a `reasoning` item (`reasoning_text`), followed by a `message` item (`output_text`)\n- **Streaming**: SSE events; answer text arrives in `response.output_text.delta` events, and generation ends with `response.completed` (or `response.incomplete` / `response.failed`)\n- **Tool calling**: Function Calling\n\n**Thinking and the output-token limit**:\n- Thinking cannot be turned off. Reasoning tokens are billed as output tokens, count toward `max_output_tokens`, and are reported in `usage.output_tokens_details.reasoning_tokens`\n- If `max_output_tokens` is not set, EvoLink uses **32768**\n- With a small limit and a high effort, thinking can use up the whole limit: the response ends with `status: \"incomplete\"` (`incomplete_details.reason: \"max_output_tokens\"`) and no `message` item. Keep the limit at 32768 or higher, and lower `reasoning.effort` for simple tasks\n- In multi-turn tool calling, add the previous response's `output` items (including `reasoning` and `function_call` items) to `input` unchanged, followed by your `function_call_output` items\n\n**Compatibility rules**:\n\n| Request | EvoLink handling |\n| --- | --- |\n| `reasoning.effort: \"none\"` / `\"minimal\"` | Changed to `low`; thinking still runs and is billed as output |\n| `service_tier` | Removed; requests always use the standard tier |\n| `store` / `previous_response_id` | No effect; responses are not stored, so send the full history in `input` |\n| `tool_choice` | Only `none` and `auto` are supported |\n| `text.format.type` | Only `text` is supported |",
        "operationId": "createResponseMiniMaxM31Flash",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ResponsesRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "simple_text": {
                  "summary": "Single-turn text conversation",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": "Introduce Hangzhou in one sentence."
                  }
                },
                "with_instructions": {
                  "summary": "Using system instructions",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "instructions": "You are a meticulous technical writer. Keep answers concise.",
                    "input": "Explain what context caching is."
                  }
                },
                "multi_turn": {
                  "summary": "Multi-turn conversation (input item array)",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": [
                      {
                        "type": "message",
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Suggest three product names for me."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "message",
                        "role": "assistant",
                        "content": "Cloudperch, Lodestar, Plumewind."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "message",
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Give me five synonyms for the second one."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "reasoning_effort": {
                  "summary": "Set thinking depth (reasoning.effort)",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": "Find the bug in this function: def add(a, b): return a - b",
                    "reasoning": {
                      "effort": "medium"
                    },
                    "max_output_tokens": 32768
                  }
                },
                "image_understanding": {
                  "summary": "Image understanding - Public image URL",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": [
                      {
                        "type": "message",
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "input_text",
                            "text": "Describe the content of this image."
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "input_image",
                            "image_url": "https://example.com/photo.jpg"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_output_tokens": 32768
                  }
                },
                "video_understanding": {
                  "summary": "Video understanding (input_video)",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": [
                      {
                        "type": "message",
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "input_text",
                            "text": "Describe what happens in this video."
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "input_video",
                            "video_url": {
                              "url": "https://example.com/video.mp4",
                              "fps": 1
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_output_tokens": 32768
                  }
                },
                "function_calling": {
                  "summary": "Function Calling",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": "What is the weather in Hangzhou right now?",
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "type": "function",
                        "name": "get_weather",
                        "description": "Query real-time weather for a given city",
                        "parameters": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "city": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "City name"
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "city"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "tool_choice": "auto"
                  }
                },
                "function_call_output": {
                  "summary": "Send back the function result (multi-turn tool calling)",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": [
                      {
                        "type": "message",
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "What is the weather in Hangzhou right now?"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "resp_066b36619b147e32_rs",
                        "type": "reasoning",
                        "status": "completed",
                        "summary": [],
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "reasoning_text",
                            "text": "The user wants the current weather in Hangzhou. I will call get_weather."
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "resp_066b36619b147e32_fc_0",
                        "type": "function_call",
                        "status": "completed",
                        "call_id": "call_function_7k2m9x4q1w_1",
                        "name": "get_weather",
                        "arguments": "{\"city\": \"Hangzhou\"}"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "function_call_output",
                        "call_id": "call_function_7k2m9x4q1w_1",
                        "output": "Sunny, 22°C"
                      }
                    ],
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "type": "function",
                        "name": "get_weather",
                        "description": "Query real-time weather for a given city",
                        "parameters": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "city": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "City name"
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "city"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "streaming": {
                  "summary": "Streaming output",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": "Write a short poem about autumn.",
                    "stream": true
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Generation successful",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ResponsesResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "completed": {
                    "summary": "Completed (reasoning item + message item)",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "resp_066b36619b147e31",
                      "object": "response",
                      "created_at": 1790000000,
                      "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                      "status": "completed",
                      "output": [
                        {
                          "id": "resp_066b36619b147e31_rs",
                          "type": "reasoning",
                          "status": "completed",
                          "summary": [],
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "reasoning_text",
                              "text": "The user wants a one-sentence introduction covering both geography and culture."
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "resp_066b36619b147e31_msg",
                          "type": "message",
                          "status": "completed",
                          "role": "assistant",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "output_text",
                              "text": "Hangzhou is the capital of Zhejiang Province, known for West Lake and its digital economy.",
                              "annotations": []
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ],
                      "output_text": "Hangzhou is the capital of Zhejiang Province, known for West Lake and its digital economy.",
                      "error": null,
                      "incomplete_details": null,
                      "usage": {
                        "input_tokens": 14,
                        "input_tokens_details": {
                          "cached_tokens": 0
                        },
                        "output_tokens": 62,
                        "output_tokens_details": {
                          "reasoning_tokens": 38
                        },
                        "total_tokens": 76
                      },
                      "parallel_tool_calls": true,
                      "store": false,
                      "truncation": "disabled"
                    }
                  },
                  "function_call": {
                    "summary": "Function call (reasoning item + function_call item)",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "resp_066b36619b147e32",
                      "object": "response",
                      "created_at": 1790000060,
                      "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                      "status": "completed",
                      "output": [
                        {
                          "id": "resp_066b36619b147e32_rs",
                          "type": "reasoning",
                          "status": "completed",
                          "summary": [],
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "reasoning_text",
                              "text": "The user wants the current weather in Hangzhou. I will call get_weather."
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "resp_066b36619b147e32_fc_0",
                          "type": "function_call",
                          "status": "completed",
                          "call_id": "call_function_7k2m9x4q1w_1",
                          "name": "get_weather",
                          "arguments": "{\"city\": \"Hangzhou\"}"
                        }
                      ],
                      "error": null,
                      "incomplete_details": null,
                      "usage": {
                        "input_tokens": 172,
                        "input_tokens_details": {
                          "cached_tokens": 0
                        },
                        "output_tokens": 45,
                        "output_tokens_details": {
                          "reasoning_tokens": 27
                        },
                        "total_tokens": 217
                      },
                      "parallel_tool_calls": true,
                      "store": false,
                      "truncation": "disabled"
                    }
                  },
                  "incomplete": {
                    "summary": "Output limit used up while thinking (status=incomplete)",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "resp_066b36619b147e33",
                      "object": "response",
                      "created_at": 1790000120,
                      "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                      "status": "incomplete",
                      "output": [
                        {
                          "id": "resp_066b36619b147e33_rs",
                          "type": "reasoning",
                          "status": "completed",
                          "summary": [],
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "reasoning_text",
                              "text": "The user wants a detailed comparison of three sorting algorithms. Let me start with time complexity: quicksort averages O(n log n) but degrades to O(n^2) when the pivot is poorly chosen, while merge sort"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ],
                      "output_text": "",
                      "error": null,
                      "incomplete_details": {
                        "reason": "max_output_tokens"
                      },
                      "usage": {
                        "input_tokens": 25,
                        "input_tokens_details": {
                          "cached_tokens": 0
                        },
                        "output_tokens": 1024,
                        "output_tokens_details": {
                          "reasoning_tokens": 1024
                        },
                        "total_tokens": 1049
                      },
                      "parallel_tool_calls": true,
                      "store": false,
                      "truncation": "disabled"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid request parameters",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 400,
                    "message": "Invalid request parameters",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Unauthenticated, invalid or expired token",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 401,
                    "message": "Invalid or expired token",
                    "type": "authentication_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "Insufficient quota, recharge required",
